  "id": "1",
  "notes": "## JIT Docker Instance Management Workflow\n\nThis workflow provides comprehensive management of JIT Docker instances:\n\n### Main Features:\n1. **Service Request Management**: Start/stop services on demand\n2. **Resource Monitoring**: Check available resources before starting services\n3. **Health Monitoring**: Monitor JIT Resource Manager health\n4. **Event Tracking**: Track service lifecycle events\n5. **Idle Timeout Management**: Automatically stop idle services\n\n### Usage:\n- Trigger: Manual, API, or event-driven\n- Input: Service ID and request parameters\n- Output: Service status and resource information\n\n### Integration Points:\n- Solace Message VPN for event triggers\n- JIT Resource Manager API\n- Prometheus for monitoring\n- Vault for secure API tokens",
  "notesInExecutionOrder": [
